{"summary":"游戏公司发布会发生爆炸误杀，柯南追查 Tequila、交换手提箱和黑衣组织情报交易之间的关系。","organizations":["organization-black"],"sources":["src-detective-conan-world-game-company-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0054"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"竹下宏信（Hironobu Takeshita）。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"竹下认为中岛秀明抛弃曾与两人交往的大学拳击部经理吉美，导致吉美自杀，因此杀害中岛并试图嫁祸。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"竹下事先调换手提箱编号，使装有炸弹的箱子在中岛与 Tequila 交换时误交给 Tequila，利用爆炸杀死目标但实际造成 Tequila 误中。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"中岛手提箱的钥匙能打开竹下手中的箱子；竹下在得知中岛箱内只有 Tequila 给的钱时表现出异常；酒店号码、调换编号和爆炸箱形成完整证据链。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"柯南揭示手提箱调换和炸弹机关，竹下认罪；随后柯南前往 Tequila 的联络地点，发现琴酒和伏特加为灭口而引发爆炸。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"Game_Company_Murder_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri","Juzo Megure","Tequila","Gin","Vodka"],"solvedBy":"Kogoro Mouri (via Conan)","dcwAirDate":"April 14, 1997","dcwMangaCaseNumber":"#32","locations":["Mantendo building"],"locationsSource":"Game_Company_Murder_Case","locationsDropped":["\"Cocktail\" bar at the Daikoku building"],"victims":[{"name":"Tequila","causeOfDeath":"Explosion","causeOfDeathZh":"爆炸致死","nameZh":"龙舌兰"}],"suspects":["Hideaki Nakajima, Koji Ueda, and Hironobu Takeshita"],"caseFactsSource":"Game_Company_Murder_Case","locationsZh":["万天堂大楼"],"suspectsZh":["中岛英明、上田浩司与竹下博信"]}